    <node id="&quot;CAPOCANNONIERE AWARD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Capocannoniere award is an annual award given to the top scorer in Serie A, which Mauro Icardi won in the 2017-2018 season."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Capocannoniere award is an event that recognizes the top scorer in Italian Serie A football."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0475</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROSARIO&quot;">
